{"props":{"pageProps":{"listing":{"id":"385523b2-1af1-42b6-9b55-06a10ad8e8f9","title":"Colosseum Crypto World's Fair Hackathon | Superteam Poland Track","slug":"colosseum-crypto-worlds-fair-hackathon-superteam-poland-track","description":"\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Superteam Poland\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eSuperteam Poland is a community of founders, developers, and operators working together to support growth and collaboration within the Solana ecosystem. We connect talented individuals with opportunities and provide resources to help them succeed within the community. For the Crypto World's Fair hackathon, we're especially excited to see the innovative projects emerging from our local Polish track.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHackathon Track Scope\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eThis track is focused on Solana projects developed by teams from Poland for the Crypto World's Fair Hackathon. We're looking for projects that deliver meaningful value to the Solana ecosystem. Consider real-world problems that Solana can address, and think about how your product can attract new users or deepen engagement among existing ones..\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRewards\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e🥇 \u003cstrong\u003eFirst Prize:\u003c/strong\u003e $2,000 USDC\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e🥈 \u003cstrong\u003eSecond Prize:\u003c/strong\u003e $1,500 USDC\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e🥉 \u003cstrong\u003eThird Prize:\u003c/strong\u003e $1,000 USDC\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e🎓 \u003cstrong\u003eBest Student Project:\u003c/strong\u003e $500 USDC\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBest Student Project - $500 USDC\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eWe're setting aside a dedicated prize for the strongest project built by students. To be eligible, \u003cstrong\u003eevery member of the team must be a current student\u003c/strong\u003e, if even one team member is not, the team can still compete for the main prizes, but not for this one. We may ask for proof of student status (student ID, university email, or equivalent) before paying out.\u003c/p\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHackathon Track: Open Track\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eThis is an open track with no thematic restrictions. Build whatever excites you, as long as it's built on Solana.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLooking for inspiration?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eCheck \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://superteam.fun/build\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSuperteam Build\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e \u003c/strong\u003e- a place with over 200 ideas that are perfect for your hackathon project.\u003c/p\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEligibility\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003col class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eThe Project must be submitted to the Colosseum portal as well as on Superteam Earn (with \u003cstrong\u003e“Poland”\u003c/strong\u003e marked as country)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eYou must submit to the Crypto World’s Fair hackathon and mark \u003cstrong\u003e\"Poland\" \u003c/strong\u003eas your country\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eYou must pitch your project IRL on our \u003ca target=\"\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://luma.com/stpldemoday\"\u003eDemo Day\u003c/a\u003e (12th October) in Warsaw\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eYour project must be eligible as per the \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.colosseum.org/hackathon#faqs\"\u003eofficial rules of the global hackathon\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eJudging Criteria\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEcosystem Impact:\u003c/strong\u003e Does the project meaningfully contribute to the Solana ecosystem through infrastructure, tooling, or tangible value?\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct-Market Fit on Solana:\u003c/strong\u003e Is there clear demand within the Solana ecosystem? Does it solve a real problem, and show early signs of traction or validation?\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUser Growth Potential:\u003c/strong\u003e Can the project attract new users to Solana or increase engagement among existing users?\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eResources\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://colosseum.com/worldsfair\"\u003eCrypto World's Fair\u003c/a\u003e - main hackathon page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://superteam.fun/hackathon\"\u003eSuperteam Hackathon Resources Website\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://colosseum.com/copilot\"\u003eColosseum Copilot\u003c/a\u003e - AI brainstorm tool for project ideas\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"http://Solana.new\"\u003eSolana.new\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.solana.new/\"\u003e \u003c/a\u003e- an all in one kit to go from idea to shipped project\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://t.me/SolanaDevsPolska\"\u003eSuperteam Poland Hackathon Group\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","deadline":"2026-10-13T06:59:00.000Z","commitmentDate":"2026-10-14T21:59:59.000Z","eligibility":[{"type":"text","order":1,"optional":false,"question":"Project Name"},{"type":"text","order":2,"optional":false,"question":"Project Description"},{"type":"link","order":3,"optional":false,"question":"Project Github Link"},{"type":"link","order":4,"optional":true,"question":"Project Website"},{"type":"link","order":5,"optional":true,"question":"Project X Link"},{"type":"link","order":6,"optional":false,"question":"Link to your pitch deck or Loom/video presentation"},{"type":"text","order":7,"optional":false,"question":"Did you submit this project to the official Frontier Hackathon on Colosseum? (Yes/No)"},{"type":"text","order":10,"optional":false,"question":"Did you submit as a polish project?"},{"type":"link","order":8,"optional":true,"question":"Link to Colosseum project"},{"type":"link","order":9,"optional":true,"question":"Link to your project's Colosseum profile"}],"status":"OPEN","token":"USDG","rewardAmount":5000,"rewards":{"1":2000,"2":1500,"3":1000,"4":500},"maxBonusSpots":0,"sponsorId":"07d95fed-6368-439b-b0e1-8b058a929e64","isPublished":true,"skills":[{"skills":"Blockchain","subskills":[]}],"type":"hackathon","requirements":null,"isWinnersAnnounced":false,"region":"Poland","pocSocials":"https://t.me/matjanisz","publishedAt":"2026-09-14T14:27:38.065Z","isPrivate":false,"agentAccess":"HUMAN_ONLY","hackathonId":"df89585d-1a7a-433a-bf4a-bdcc7a6e0070","compensationType":"fixed","maxRewardAsk":null,"minRewardAsk":null,"isFndnPaying":true,"winnersAnnouncedAt":null,"isPro":false,"sponsor":{"name":"Superteam Poland","logo":"https://res.cloudinary.com/dgvnuwspr/image/upload/v1735037147/dcaqzttnfyeijntcozyn.png","slug":"superteam-poland","url":"https://x.com/mihal_wojtas","entityName":"Superteam Poland","isVerified":true,"isCaution":false},"poc":{"id":"527ce004-5f11-4f7c-aa6c-3a28920122d2","firstName":"Matt","lastName":"J","username":"_matjanisz","photo":""},"Hackathon":{"logo":"https://res.cloudinary.com/dgvnuwspr/image/upload/assets/hackathon/crypto-world-fair/logo.png","altLogo":"https://res.cloudinary.com/dgvnuwspr/image/upload/assets/hackathon/crypto-world-fair/logo.png","startDate":"2026-09-14T15:00:00.000Z","deadline":"2026-10-13T06:59:00.000Z","name":"Crypto World's Fair","description":"Submit to the side tracks of the latest Solana Global Hackathon","slug":"crypto-worlds-fair","announceDate":null,"sponsorId":"be05612f-e760-446b-805d-0191b40e37f2","Sponsor":{"name":"Crypto Worlds Fair","logo":"https://res.cloudinary.com/dgvnuwspr/image/upload/assets/hackathon/crypto-world-fair/logo.png","slug":"Crypto-worlds-fair","url":"","entityName":null,"isVerified":true,"isCaution":false}}},"isPreview":false,"dehydratedState":{"mutations":[],"queries":[{"dehydratedAt":1790207255907,"state":{"data":0,"dataUpdateCount":1,"dataUpdatedAt":1790207255907,"error":null,"errorUpdateCount":0,"errorUpdatedAt":